tags: statement-query, statement_query_mu

A rate of the node: the price of one answer of GetBalanceStatement.

The value is MU for one. Example: 100. The node takes it from the balance that
pays for the action.

The rate has no scope. A reader that does not know the rate ignores it.

=== formal
base=one
class=rate
name=statement-query
of=one GetBalanceStatement answer, charged to the caller before the node answers
scope=none
